{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19360","headline":"馆娃宫在旧郡西南砚石山前瞰姑苏台傍有采香径梁天监中置佛寺曰灵岩即故宫也信爲绝境因赋二章 一 · 刘禹锡","name":"馆娃宫在旧郡西南砚石山前瞰姑苏台傍有采香径梁天监中置佛寺曰灵岩即故宫也信爲绝境因赋二章 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宫馆贮娇娃，当时意大夸。\n艳倾吴国尽，笑入楚王家。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19360.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19360","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言绝句","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}